OL,3,GNEWSAVulnerable kids' records caught up
OL,4,Ain cyber attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FHCRG declined to confirm the scale of
OL,7,Fthe incident, but said it included "a
OL,8,Fcross-section" of patients and the
OL,9,F"complex" investigation had "only
OL,10,Frecently concluded", accounting for any
OL,11,Fdelays.
